# HTTP Log Investigation

This project focuses on investigating HTTP log data using Splunk.

## Objective

To analyze HTTP logs, understand web traffic, identify relevant events, and investigate potentially suspicious activity using Splunk.

## Tools Used

- Splunk
- SPL
- HTTP Log Data

## Investigation

HTTP log data was ingested into Splunk and analyzed using SPL queries.

## Key Areas

- HTTP request analysis
- Source IP analysis
- HTTP status code analysis
- Request/URL analysis
- Log investigation
